          "class": "s19",
          "colspan": "11"
        },
        "text": "Intrinsic Arc Subclass Buff\nObtained by reaching 100% Counter Progress through Arc Kills within 6 seconds of each, or through Aspects.\nRank-And-File = 25% | Elite = 50% | Miniboss+ = 100% | Guardians = 50%\n\nAmplified:\n+50 Mobility, increases Slide Distance to 8.5 meters, +40 Handling, and 0.95x Handling Duration Multiplier for 15 seconds. \nCombatants are less accurate at targeting the wearer and grants 15% Damage Resist against Combatants while active.\nWhile Amplified, sprinting for 2.5 seconds grants Speed Booster.\n\nSpeed Booster:\nMaximizes Movement Speed, increased Slide Distance to 11 meters, 25% Increased Jump Height, and 15% Damage Resist against Combatants.\nSpeed Booster lingers for 2 seconds until no longer sprinting, even after Amplified runs out.\nPerforming a Speed Booster Slide permanently increases base Slide Distance from 6.5 meters to 8.5 meters until death."
      },
      {
        "kind": "td",
        "attrs": {
          "class": "s20"
        },
        "text": ""
      }
