        "text": "Jolted Enemies will release chain lightning for 10 [5] seconds, dealing 119 [51] Arc Damage to all enemies within 12 meters upon taking 115 [45] damage. \nDuration can be refreshed by reinflicting Jolt.\n The damage from the hit that applies Jolt counts towards the damage threshold. Jolt has a 0.8 second cooldown between chain lightning activations.\n\nGuardians that release Chain Lightning do not receive chain damage unless it deals damage to other Guardians.\n\nOverload Champions become Stunned upon receiving Jolt damage."
