      {
        "kind": "td",
        "attrs": {
          "class": "s20",
          "colspan": "11"
        },
        "text": "Cloaks the user, granting various benefits, while lowering Maximum Radar Range to 24 meters for 5+2 seconds. Immediately ends upon performing an Offensive Action.\n Radar Booster Weapon Mod removes the Radar Reduction. Reapplying Invisibility without it breaking refreshes the duration of the longest lasting invisibility.\n\nCombatants are unable to directly target the user, preferring to either shoot at the user's last visible location, or not firing. Combatants will track through Loud Actions, but not fire.\n\nGuardians are unable to see the user's health bar, and the user's radar will only ping every 5 seconds for 0.6 seconds, or upon performing Loud Actions.\n\nWeapons and Abilities that are able to home in (Tracking Projectiles) or scan (Firebolt Grenades) for enemies will not target the user, and will stop tracking if they already were. \n\nOffensive Actions: Instantly ends Invisibility\nShooting | Grenade, Melee, Super, or Blink Ability Usage | Barricade or Rift Placement | Vehicle Summon\n\nLoud Actions: Pings Radar | Combatants Track\nBeginning Sprint | Non-Blink Movement Ability Usage | Hunter Class Ability Usage"
      },
      {
        "kind": "td",
        "attrs": {
          "class": "s15"
        },
        "text": ""
      }
    ]
  },
