          "class": "s18",
          "colspan": "11"
        },
        "text": "Weakened Enemies receive 15% [7.5%] increased damage and 20% Decreased Movement Speed for 6 [2.5] seconds.\n\nWeakened Combatants become less accurate and slower.\n\nUnique Weaken Effects:\nCertain sources of Weaken inflict a dramatically stronger weaken that grants 30% [generally 50%] increased damage.\n\nShadowshot: Moebius grants 30% [50%] increased damage against tethered enemies.\n\nFelwinter's Helm's Warlord's End grants 30% [30%] increased damage against enemies affected by its weakening burst.\nTractor Cannon's Repulsor Force and Fafnir (Quantum Nova Active) grants 30% [50%] increased damage against enemies it damages.\nFafnir's, Felwinter's, Tractor's weaken duration can be extended by any other Weaken effect.\n\nShadowshot: Deadfall uniquely grants 35% [50%?] increased damage against tethered enemies."
      },
      {
